4. Added proper module mocking using `jest.mock`
5. Included error boundaries and loading states
6. Properly typed the components and their props
7. Added proper handling of the window object to avoid SSR issues

The changes should resolve the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module" error by:
1. Properly handling the async nature of the component
2. Providing all necessary mock dependencies
3. Using proper error boundaries and suspense
